-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",172,{
[5473]="7001BDB0\n1\tTake the gate of one of the Orc-fortifications\tDurbúrz-stazg lies to the north of Echad Sirion. Fállug lies to the south of Echad Sirion. Fuirgam has ordered you to take the gate of one of the Orc-fortifications along the banks of the Anduin river.\n2\tHold the gate against the Enemy\tDurbúrz-stazg lies to the north of Echad Sirion. Fállug lies to the south of Echad Sirion. Now that you have taken the gate of one of the Orc-fortifications, you must hold it against the Enemy. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Fuirgam's Aide at Echad Sirion\tFuirgam's Aide is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern bank of the Anduin. You should return to him with tidings of your victory.\n",
[5474]="7001C06B\n1\tJam the gate mechanism\tThe Gostannon lies in the north-west corner of the Mirk-eaves, some distance to the east of Echad Sirion. Fuirgam has asked you to jam the mechanism of the Gostannon to delay enemy reinforcements from coming out of the east.\n2\tTalk to Fuirgam's Aide at Echad Sirion\tFuirgam's Aide is at Echad Sirion, west of the Gostannon. You should return to him with your report.\n",
[5475]="7000F9DC\n1\tTalk to Elrond in Rivendell\tElrond is in the library of his house in Rivendell. Elrond Halfelven has summoned you to speak with him on some urgent matter.\n2\tHelp Boromir with his preparations\030Help Aragorn with his preparations\tAragorn and Boromir can be found in one of the guest rooms along the road that winds up the southern slope of the Vale of Imladris. Elrond has asked that you help your fellow Men, Aragorn son of Arathorn and Boromir of Gondor, prepare to leave on their dangerous -- and secret -- mission.\n3\tTalk to Elrond in Rivendell\tElrond is in his library within the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. You have helped both Aragorn and Boromir with their preparations and should return now to Elrond.\n",
[5476]="7001C06A\n1\tDestroy Orc-catapults (total: 3)\030Destroy Orc-ballistae (total: 3)\tSiege-engines can be found at the Gostannon Orc-camp, north-east of Echad Sirion. Fuirgam has asked you to destroy the Orkish siege-engines in the Mirk-eaves.\n2\tTalk to Fuirgam's Aide at Echad Sirion\tFuirgam's Aide is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin, south-west of the Gostannon. You should return to him with news of your success.\n",
[5477]="7001BB5F\n1\tDefeat Taughâsh Riders (total: 7)\tTaughâsh Riders can be found throughout the Mirk-eaves. Fuirgam has asked you to defeat the Taughâsh Riders that have been harassing the flanks of the Malledhrim soldiers invading the Mirk-eaves.\n2\tTalk to Fuirgam's Aide at Echad Sirion\tFuirgam's Aide is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin. You should bring your report back to him.\n",
[5478]="7001C06C\n1\tTalk to Fuirgam's Aide at Echad Sirion when you are ready to begin the assault on Amon Angened\tFuirgam's Aide is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin. You should speak with him when you are ready to venture forth to conquer the fort atop Amon Angened, overlooking the Mirk-eaves.\n2\tTalk to Alfirimbes at Echad Sirion\tAlfirimbes is at Echad Sirion on the eastern banks of the Anduin. Fuirgam has asked you to return to speak with Alfirimbes, who is re-organizing the Malledhrim forces in the Mirk-eaves after the success of the landing.\n",
[5479]="7000F9DD\n1\tLook for Frodo's notes at the Imdolen Look-out\tThe Imdolen Look-out is a stone pavilion north of Rivendell that overlooks the valley. Frodo has asked you to find the notes he left behind at the Imdolen Look-out.\n2\tBring Frodo's notes to him in Rivendell\tFrodo is in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the House of Elrond. Arwen has given you the notes she found at Imdolen Look-out. You should return them now to Frodo.\n",
[5480]="7000F9DE\n1\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond waits to speak with you in the library of his house in Rivendell. Elrond Halfelven has summoned you to speak with him on some urgent matter.\n2\tHelp Frodo with his preparations\030Help Pippin with his preparations\030Help Sam with his preparations\tFrodo Baggins, Samwise Gamgee, and Peregrin Took can be found in Bilbo's room on the first floor of Elrond's house. Elrond has asked that you aid Frodo, Sam, and Pippin with their preparations. As you are of their kind, you may be able to lend them courage for the dangerous secret journey that awaits them.\n3\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond is in the library of his house in Rivendell. You have aided the hobbits with their preparations and should now return to Elrond.\n",
[5481]="7000F9DF\n1\tBring Sam's coinpurse to Grafinn\tGrafinn is at the Forges of Rivendell in the north-west corner of the valley. Trusting you as a hobbit of good sense, Samwise Gamgee has given you a small coinpurse and a list of items to buy from the provisioner at the Forges of Rivendell.\n2\tBring both the coinpurse and the goods to Sam in Rivendell\tSamwise Gamgee is in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the House of Elrond. Grafinn has given you the items Sam requested, but has refused to accept the coins he sent for their purchase.\n",
[5482]="7001C06D\n1\tDefeat Taughâsh War-leaders (total: 2)\tTaughâsh War-leaders can be found throughout the Mirk-eaves. Fuirgam has asked you to defeat Taughâsh War-leaders which command the Enemy forces in the Mirk-eaves.\n2\tTalk to Fuirgam's Aide at Echad Sirion\tFuirgam's Aide is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin. You should return to him with news of your success.\n",
[5483]="700533A0\n1\tExamine the old, brass button\tYou have discovered an old, brass button in the ruined tunnels of Tûn Melen. You wonder how it came to be here.\n",
[5484]="7001BE9A\n1\tDestroy supply-crates (total: 8)\tSupplies can be found at Durbúrz-stazg to the north of Echad Sirion and Fállug to the south. Fuirgam has asked you to find and destroy the supply-crates in the Orc-fortifications of the Mirk-eaves.\n2\tTalk to Fuirgam's Aide at Echad Sirion\tFuirgam's Aide is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin. You should return to him with news of your success.\n",
[5485]="7000F9E0\n1\tTalk to Glóin\tGlóin is at his camp in the Misty Mountains, north of Rivendell. Gimli has asked you to speak with his father about the possibility that Gandalf might bring the company through Moria, to the halls of Balin.\n2\tTalk to Gandalf in Rivendell\tGandalf is in Bilbo's room on the ground floor of the House of Elrond, in Rivendell. Glóin has sent you to Gandalf to inquire about Moria and the ring of Thrór on behalf of Gimli.\n3\tTalk to Gimli in Rivendell\tGimli is in one of the guest rooms down the road from Elrond's House. Gandalf has reprimanded Gimli for inattentiveness and urged him to think only of the company's errand.\n",
[5486]="7005AB69\n1\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n2\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Azanulbizar\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found near the entrance to Azanulbizar. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n",
[5487]="7000F9E7\n1\tTalk to Elrond and see the Company off on their secret errand\tElrond is in the library of his house. You have earned the right to see the Company off as they depart on their secret errand.\n2\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond is in the library of his house. You have seen the Company off on their secret errand and should now speak with Elrond.\n",
[5488]="7000F9E1\n1\tTalk to a sentinel at the southern entrance of the Vale\tThe guards at the southern entrance to the Vale of Imladris are atop the road that winds up the southern slope from the guest rooms. Boromir has asked you to see if the guards at the southern entrance to the Vale of Imladris require the strength of his arm in the valley's defence.\n2\tTalk to Boromir in Rivendell\tBoromir is in one of the guest rooms of Elrond's House. The guards at the southern entrance to the valley have politely rebuffed Boromir's offer of aid.\n3\tThe Hall of Fire is on the first floor of the House of Elrond, in Rivendell. Boromir chafes at the lack of respect for your people's sacrifices that he sees in Rivendell and wants you to tell some tales of the great deeds of the Race of Men to Elf-singers in the Hall of Fire.\t\n4\tTalk to Boromir in Rivendell\tBoromir is in one of the guest rooms of Elrond's House. You have spoken of the deeds of Men in the Hall of Fire and should now return to Boromir.\n",
[5489]="7000F9E2\n1\tTalk to Elrond in the Last Homely House\tElrond is in the library of his house. Pippin has asked that you thank Elrond for the use of the walking-stick he borrowed and to tell him that the hobbit will return it shortly.\n2\tTalk to Pippin in Rivendell\tPippin is in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the House of Elrond. Pippin borrowed the Sceptre of Annúminas, thinking it a complimentary walking-stick, and now Elrond wants it returned.\n3\tFind the Sceptre of Annúminas\tPippin thinks he left the Sceptre of Annúminas atop some large grey boulders near the forges, west of the road that climbs up into the mountains. Pippin has asked you, as a fellow hobbit, to find the Sceptre of Annúminas, the 'walking-stick' he left somewhere in Rivendell.\n4\tPippin is in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the House of Elrond. Elrond is in his library. You have recovered the Sceptre of Annúminas and should return it now to either Pippin or Elrond.\t\n",
[5490]="7000F9E3\n1\tTalk to Gandalf in Rivendell\tGandalf is in Bilbo's room on the first floor of the House of Elrond. Aragorn has asked you to bring word of the two ways south he sees for the Company: by the Redhorn Gate over the mountains, or through the Gap of Rohan.\n2\tTalk to Aragorn in Rivendell\tAragorn is in one of the guest rooms of Elrond's House. Gandalf has asked that you return to Aragorn with his misgivings about the two ways the Ranger has considered for the Company's route and to speak to him of a third way the party might take.\n",
[5491]="7000F9E4\n1\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond waits in the library of his house in Rivendell. Elrond Halfelven has summoned you to speak with him on some urgent matter.\n2\tHelp Gimli with his preparations\030Help Legolas with his preparations\tLegolas and Gimli are in one of the guest rooms along the road that winds up the southern slope of the Vale of Imladris. Elrond has asked you to help Legolas the Elf and Gimli the Dwarf with their preparations for the journey.\n3\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond is in the library of his house in Rivendell. You have aided Legolas and Gimli with their preparations and should speak now with Elrond.\n",
[5492]="7000F9E5\n1\tTalk to Erestor\tErestor is at the Haven of Orladion, north-west of the House of Elrond. Legolas is concerned that strong words following the Council of Elrond may have caused Erestor to resent him, and he wants you to apologize on his behalf.\n2\tTalk to Galdor\tGaldor of the Havens is at the stables in the north-west corner of Rivendell. You have brought word of Legolas's apology to Erestor and should now do the same for Galdor.\n3\tBring the white knife to Legolas in Rivendell\tLegolas is in one of the guest rooms of Elrond's House. Galdor has given you a white knife to give to Legolas as a token of his forgiveness.\n",
[5493]="70049558\n1\tCollect chunks of raw obsidian near Orodruin (total: 8)\030Collect wood-scraps from ruined banner poles in Dor Amarth (total: 8)\030Collect steel from a ruined shard of Barad-dûr\tObsidian can be found near lava-floes around Orodruin, wood can be salvaged from ruined banner poles on the plains of Dor Amarth, and shards of Barad-dûr's steel can be found in the lands surrounding Sauron's fallen tower. Sversting has asked you to gather obsidian, wood, and a shard of Barad-dûr's steel that he might craft a weapon of renown in honour of their lost King.\n2\tDeliver the obsidian, wood, and steel to Sversting in Lûghash\tSversting can be found at the forges of Lûghash. You have gathered much obsidian, wood, and even a shard of Barad-dûr itself. You should now deliver them to Sversting at the forges of Lûghash.\n",
[5494]="7004DA6E\n1\tStout-axe smiths can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain and before the gates of Erebor. Ambassador Spakorth has asked you to send Stout-axe smiths to the forges of Erebor to aid Durin's Folk in their delving and crafting.\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have sent many Stout-axe smiths to the forges of Erebor.\n",
[5495]="70017518\n1\tDefeat Narkû to alert Kranklûk of your presence\tThe Forges of Khazad-dûm are to the south-west of the Twenty-first Hall. The dwarf Sigurd has challenged you to fight your way to the Orc Kranklûk. Narkû, who stands between you and your intended quarry, will undoubtedly alert Kranklûk that you are coming. You will have a limited amount of time in which to accomplish your task after the warning goes out.\n2\tDefeat Kranklûk before the time runs out\tKranklûk is in the heart of the Forges of Khazad-Dûm. Narkû has been defeated and Kranklûk is alerted of your presence. Sigurd believes that Kranklûk is the driving force in the Forges of Khazad-dûm; he wants you to defeat your foe to hinder the efforts of the Orcs. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tReturn to Sigurd at the Twenty-first Hall\tSigurd is in the Twenty-first Hall, north-east of the Forges of Khazad-dûm where the Orcs hold their camp. Sigurd will wish to hear if you have risen to meet the challenge he gave you of slaying Kranklûk in the allotted time.\n",
[5496]="7001751D\n1\tKill enemies in The Forges of Khazad-dûm (total: 30)\tThe Forges of Khazad-dûm are far to the south-west of the Twenty-first Hall. The dwarf Geirr has challenged you to make your way into the Forges of Khazad-dûm and defeat many Orcs therein.\n2\tReturn to Geirr at the Twenty-first Hall\tThe dwarf Geirr is in the Twenty-first hall, north-east of the Forges where the Orcs hold their camp. Geirr will wish to hear if you have been brave enough to enter the Forges of Khazad-dûm and face the Orcs in battle.\n",
[5497]="7001750F\n1\tReturn the brand to Eilíefr at the Twenty-first Hall\030Collect Kranklûk's brand\tKranklûk is in the Forges of Khazad-dûm, south-west of Eilíefr's post at the Twenty-first Hall. The dwarf Eilíefr has challenged you to make your way into the Forges and defeat the Orc who leads the rabble there, and then return with Kranklûk's brand as a token of your victory.\n",
[5498]="70015685\n1\tDisable forges at Ânghumu-ru\tForges can be found in Ânghumu-ru in the north-west quadrant of the Flaming Deeps. You should disable the forges to hinder the weapon-craft of the Ghâsh-hai.\n2\tDisable forges at Ânghumu-ru (total: 2)\tForges can be found in Ânghumu-ru in the north-west quadrant of the Flaming Deeps. You should disable the forges to hinder the weapon-craft of the Ghâsh-hai.\n3\tCompleted\tThe forges of Ânghumu-ru are disabled, and the Orcs will now be hindered in their crafting of new weapons.\n",
[5499]="70037E93\n1\tCollect White Hand swords (total: 4)\tThe White Hand Orcs were seen near the mountains to the north-west of Aldburg. Éothain has asked you to collect Orc-swords from which they might smelt steel to repair his sword and others.\n2\tTalk to Éothain\tÉothain is in Aldburg, south-east of the mountains. You should bring the swords you gathered back to Éothain.\n",
[5500]="700076B2\n1\tReforge the Barrow-key\tThe forge lies within the Great Barrow. Naerandir instructed you to remake the Barrow-key anew at the forge of Othrongroth.\n",
[5501]="7004689A\n1\tForge blades (total: 5)\tYou should smith some weapons at the forge in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor.\n2\tCool blades (total: 5)\tThe cooling bucket is located next to the forge in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor. You should cool the recently forged weapons.\n3\tPlace the cooled weapons in an empty barrel\tAn empty weapons barrel is located near the forge in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor. You should place the cooled weapons in a barrel.\n4\tTalk to Angbor\tAngbor can be found at Aragorn's Pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor. You should talk to Angbor.\n",
[5502]="7004014B\n1\tCollect Orc-blades (total: 3)\030Collect Orc-staves (total: 3)\030Collect Orc-daggers (total: 3)\tOrcs can be found throughout Tingobel in north-eastern Blackroot Vale, to the north of Lancrath. Boradan has asked you to steal weapons from the Orcs you defeat in hopes that their numbers and hold on Tingobel shall diminish.\n2\tDeliver the Orc-weapons to Boradan\tBoradan can be found in Lancrath in south-eastern Blackroot Vale. You have taken many of the Orcs' weapons and should now bring them to Boradan.\n",
[5503]="7004DA6C\n1\tMistrustful dwarves can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain and outside Erebor. After learning that several dwarves are having misgivings about welcoming the Stout-axes into Erebor, King Thorin III has asked you to speak to mistrustful dwarves on the Stout-axes' behalf.\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have spoken to the mistrustful Dwarves of Erebor on behalf of the Stout-axes and King Thorin III.\n",
[5504]="700076AF\n1\tBring the items for repair to Kenton Thistleway\tKenton Thistleway can be found at the southern end of Thornley's Work-site north along the Greenway. Lofar Ironband has agreed to forge a new blade for Kenton Thistleway, but in exchange, Lofar has given you three items to take to Kenton for him to repair. The dwarf said that if he likes Kenton's work, he will call it even on the cost of the two swords he is having to make.\n2\tCollect iron straps\030Collect flawless boar-hides (total: 3)\030Search for trinkets (total: 3)\tForeman Rosethorn is east under the canopy at Thornley's Work-site. Boars can be found all over on the outskirts of Bree-town. The debris-piles in the boar-hollow to the south-east of Thornley's may contain hidden treasure. Kenton can repair the items you brought from Lofar, but needs your help gathering the materials he needs. Speak to Foreman Rosethorn about iron straps to repair the helm. For the bellows, gather some flawless boar hides. Finally, search the debris in the boar-hollow for trinkets Kenton can use to decorate the axe-haft.\n3\tBring the collected materials to Kenton Thistleway\tKenton Thistleway can be found at the southern edge of Thornley's Work-site, north along the Greenway. Kenton Thistleway sent you to gather materials he can use to finish his work for Lofar Ironband. You should return to Kenton at once with the materials you found.\n",
})
